    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/55dda908b75ad0e256383c9216fad048.avif?t=1748868425\" width=500 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUBMERSED 2 - THE HIVE</strong> is a first-person science-fiction horror game, set in the harrowing depths of the Atlantic Ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of <strong>SUBMERSED 2 - THE HIVE</strong> and face the horror of being submerged at the bottom of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/2d2e2b52fccd224b3b04dede75335475.poster.avif?t=1748868425\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/2d2e2b52fccd224b3b04dede75335475.webm?t=1748868425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/2d2e2b52fccd224b3b04dede75335475.mp4?t=1748868425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find resources and weapons, investigate terminals and secret documents, and discover the hidden truth in the underwater facilities where you are trapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your deepest fears and fight the terrible creatures that hide in the deep water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the last survivors in the underwater station and live the events that will be part of the destiny of the facility and all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory very carefully: items, weapons, and ammunition are very limited.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ingenious puzzles and challenges, mixing different original mechanics, to advance in searching for answers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the most terrible predators: different types of enemies and sea creatures await you in the depths.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for different strategies for each situation. Use your few weapons, create traps or distractions, or hide from the dangers that await you at the bottom of the ocean.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its immersive atmosphere, quality graphics, and oppressive sound design create a terrifying world to explore.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUBMERSED 2 - THE HIVE</strong> contains scenes of violence, gore, nudity, and explicit language. Enjoy it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/55dda908b75ad0e256383c9216fad048.avif?t=1748868425\" width=500 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUBMERSED 2 - THE HIVE</strong> is a first-person science-fiction horror game, set in the harrowing depths of the Atlantic Ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of <strong>SUBMERSED 2 - THE HIVE</strong> and face the horror of being submerged at the bottom of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/2d2e2b52fccd224b3b04dede75335475.poster.avif?t=1748868425\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/2d2e2b52fccd224b3b04dede75335475.webm?t=1748868425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637170/extras/2d2e2b52fccd224b3b04dede75335475.mp4?t=1748868425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find resources and weapons, investigate terminals and secret documents, and discover the hidden truth in the underwater facilities where you are trapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your deepest fears and fight the terrible creatures that hide in the deep water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the last survivors in the underwater station and live the events that will be part of the destiny of the facility and all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory very carefully: items, weapons, and ammunition are very limited.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ingenious puzzles and challenges, mixing different original mechanics, to advance in searching for answers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the most terrible predators: different types of enemies and sea creatures await you in the depths.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for different strategies for each situation. Use your few weapons, create traps or distractions, or hide from the dangers that await you at the bottom of the ocean.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its immersive atmosphere, quality graphics, and oppressive sound design create a terrifying world to explore.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUBMERSED 2 - THE HIVE</strong> contains scenes of violence, gore, nudity, and explicit language. Enjoy it!</p>",
